  "changes": [
    "Five Moonshard basic IDs3253/6198011/6198021/6198031/6198041 apply passive-derived30-percent disarm477 for3000ms on settled nonlethal contact",
    "Enhanced6198011 separately rolls30-percent2000ms sleep561 from native stunBuffProb/stunBuffDuration; binding to561 is client-data inference",
    "Separate mob basic-attack, active-skill, movement-root and full-control restrictions; known skill-only silences no longer fully freeze mob",
    "Monster skill selection and unreleased windup advance both check restrictions; application immediately cancels only a prohibited unreleased cast",
    "Already released projectile/effect remains; pending cast cooldown not refunded on interruption",
    "Both sleep478 and enhanced561 wake after successful HP damage; unrelated disarm retained",
    "Player-applied mob status bound to original source world/room/map and target spawn token; stale source cannot keep old status or DOT acting after session transfer"
  ],
  "policies": {
    "activation": "Disarm uses WeaponScheme.skill3 level1 passive549 buffProb/duration for matching basic547 IDs. Applies on settled nonlethal contact, including shield-only contact, through existing OnHit. No extra skill549 projectile or automatic activation for other weapons invented. Probability independent for each contact using existing crypto RNG; tests inject boundary rolls.",
    "enhancedSleep": "Basic6198011 has stunBuffProb30/stunBuffDuration2000. BuffScheme561 is explicitly enhanced Moonshard sleep and BuffCfg maps stun_18 to561. This specific args-to561 binding is an inference from matching native data, not recovered server implementation. Two independent rolls; ordinary disarm and enhanced sleep can coexist.",
    "restrictions": "Disarm IDs388/417/477/662/663 ban native isSkill=false actions; skill silence302/504/696 bans isSkill=true actions. Their movement remains allowed. Legacy205 cannot-attack is interpreted as banning both action classes without immobilizing; that interpretation is local. Root/name and full-control rules otherwise retain previous implementation. Complete status taxonomy remains incomplete.",
    "bosses": "Uses declared SkillScheme.isSkill, without guessed basic-name exceptions. All currently registered Map2 boss skills are marked true, including some named attacks; disarm alone therefore does not block them. Complete retail boss basic/skill distinction and immunity activation remain unverified.",
    "interruption": "New restriction cancels prohibited unreleased windup and sends skillStop; accepted cooldown retained. Released effects are not removed/replayed. Retail per-skill interruption exceptions not recovered.",
